Upstream-Name: whisper.cpp ggml models
Source: https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
Comment: The weights are downloaded at build time from the repository named above,
 at the names and checksums recorded in models.txt, and installed byte for byte as
 published: nothing in this package retrains, quantises or converts them.
